  abstract = {This paper describes the design and implementation of Egalitarian Paxos (EPaxos), a distributed consensus algorithm based on Paxos. EPaxos targets optimal wide-area commit latency, uniform load balancing across replicas, and graceful performance degradation when replicas are slow or crash. In the common case, commands commit in one communication round; interfering commands may require an additional round to establish dependencies and order.}
